      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Mar<15>2010 19:19 Oct 11, 2011 Jkt 226001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\12OCE0.SGM 12OCE0jlentini on DSK4TPTVN1PROD with FRE0\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n63534 Federal Register / Vol. 76, No. 197 / Wednesday, October 12, 2011 / Presidential Documents"
